{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.invLift_defect_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.invLift_defect_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L154-L164","doc":"The defect vanishes exactly where the shared object does, so the two lifts\nagree only on the fixed locus `z = 0` (`u² = 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.colourCurve27_invLift_defect","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.colourCurve27_invLift_defect","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L145-L152","doc":"Under the skein arc's lift, `r` has defect `10·z·(4z² + 3)` — the *same*\nformula `qou-fi93` and `qou-ndt5` record as the \"bar defect\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.colourCurve27_ndt5Lift_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.colourCurve27_ndt5Lift_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L138-L143","doc":"Under the colour-curve arc's lift, `r` is **exactly** bar-invariant —\nzero defect, not a small one.  (This is `ColourCurveBarVsBranch`'s result,\nrestated here so the two lifts stand side by side.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.colourCurve27","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.colourCurve27","kind":"def","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L134-L136","doc":"The colour curve, carrying its 27 rather than dividing by it, so that\nnothing below needs `27 ≠ 0`.  `27·r(x)` in the corpus's normalisation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.z_parity_not_determined","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.z_parity_not_determined","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L121-L130","doc":"**The parity of `z` is not determined by the bar on `q`.**  Both lifts\nsquare to `q⁻¹`, and they disagree wherever `z u ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.z_ndt5Lift_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.z_ndt5Lift_even","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L116-L119","doc":"Under the colour-curve lift `u ↦ −u⁻¹`, the same object is **bar-EVEN**. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.z_invLift_odd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.z_invLift_odd","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L111-L114","doc":"Under the skein lift `u ↦ u⁻¹`, the shared object is **bar-ODD**. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.lifts_differ_by_branch","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.lifts_differ_by_branch","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L104-L107","doc":"**The two lifts differ by exactly the branch swap** — the map `qou-ndt5`\nasks about.  So the ambiguity in the lift *is* the branch ambiguity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.ndt5Lift_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.ndt5Lift_sq","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L101-L102","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.invLift_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.invLift_sq","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L98-L99","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.branchSwap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.branchSwap","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L93-L94","doc":"The branch swap: the other square root of the same `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.ndt5Lift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.ndt5Lift","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L90-L91","doc":"The colour-curve arc's lift (`ColourCurveBarVsBranch.barLift`): `u ↦ −u⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.invLift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.invLift","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L87-L88","doc":"The skein arc's lift of the bar: `u ↦ u⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.BarLiftAmbiguity.z","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/BarLiftAmbiguity.lean#L84-L85","doc":"The shared object.  `= SkeinNormalisation.sJ = ColourCurveBarVsBranch.zOf`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}